  "lyrics": [
    {"beat": 8.15, "text": "All aboard!", "at": [0.0, 1.85]},
    {"beat": 20.55, "text": "Tickets, please...", "at": [0.0, 2.6]},
    {"beat": 33.15, "text": "Well, howdy there, little ticker, ain't you runnin' kinda slow?", "at": [0.0, 3.0, 3.25, 4.05, 4.15, 5.85, 6.05, 6.3, 7.1, 8.15]},
    {"beat": 43.2, "text": "I'm the meanest hunk of iron on the midnight railroad!", "at": [0.0, 0.35, 0.45, 1.65, 1.9, 2.65, 3.5, 3.9, 4.4, 5.55]},
    {"beat": 50.15, "text": "Got a furnace in my belly and a whistle in my throat,", "at": [0.0, 1.5, 1.6, 2.4, 3.1, 3.6, 4.15, 5.1, 5.5, 6.0, 6.85, 7.4]},
    {"beat": 58.15, "text": "So listen close, my little clock, here comes my favorite note... ^TOOT!", "at": [0.0, 0.55, 1.1, 2.15, 2.5, 3.1, 4.95, 5.45, 5.9, 6.65, 7.55, 8.95]},
    {"beat": 67.75, "text": "Now wouldn't it be a pity? Wouldn't it be a crime,", "at": [0.0, 0.1, 0.4, 0.9, 1.4, 1.9, 3.4, 4.5, 4.85, 5.5, 5.8]},
    {"beat": 74.2, "text": "If a ^BOXCAR came a-tumblin' down and flattened you in time?", "at": [0.0, 1.1, 1.9, 2.45, 2.95, 4.4, 5.1, 5.45, 6.35, 6.95, 7.4]},
    {"beat": 83.15, "text": "And wouldn't it be tragic? Wouldn't it be grim,", "at": [0.0, 0.5, 1.5, 1.6, 2.05, 4.55, 5.2, 5.85, 6.1]},
    {"beat": 90.35, "text": "If a pile of burnin' ^COAL came a-hoppin' on your limbs?", "at": [0.0, 0.75, 1.2, 1.8, 2.35, 3.2, 4.4, 4.8, 6.2, 6.75, 7.25]},
    {"beat": 98.55, "text": "It's the end of the line! Chugga chugga choo! Chugga chugga choo!", "at": [0.0, 0.7, 1.15, 2.1, 2.6, 3.15, 4.6, 4.7, 5.25, 6.1, 6.2, 7.25]},
    {"beat": 107.1, "text": "The end of the line! I'm comin' for you!", "at": [0.0, 1.0, 1.55, 2.05, 2.55, 3.65, 4.55, 5.5, 6.55]},
    {"beat": 115.25, "text": "Tick-tock, little clock, your ticket's overdue,", "at": [0.0, 1.45, 2.0, 3.85, 4.4, 5.9]},
    {"beat": 123.1, "text": "It's the end of the line! ^TOOT! ^TOOT! Choo-choo!", "at": [0.0, 0.1, 1.0, 2.6, 4.05, 4.65, 6.1, 6.2, 7.65]},
    {"beat": 146.1, "text": "I've flattened forty pocket-watches, sixty cuckoo clocks,", "at": [0.0, 0.5, 1.55, 2.5, 4.65, 5.55, 6.9]},
    {"beat": 154.8, "text": "I ran down a grandfather and I crushed his tick-a-tocks!", "at": [0.0, 0.1, 0.9, 1.35, 1.95, 3.3, 4.35, 4.9, 5.4, 5.95]},
    {"beat": 163.6, "text": "So wouldn't it be dreadful? Wouldn't it be sad,", "at": [0.0, 0.1, 0.7, 1.45, 1.75, 4.1, 4.7, 5.45, 6.05]},
    {"beat": 170.2, "text": "If a ^TRUNK fell off the luggage rack? Golly, that'd be bad!", "at": [0.0, 0.85, 1.5, 1.85, 2.4, 3.05, 3.4, 4.1, 5.45, 6.45, 7.0, 7.1]},
    {"beat": 179.15, "text": "And wouldn't it be awful? Wouldn't it be cruel,", "at": [0.0, 0.5, 1.5, 1.85, 2.6, 4.5, 5.15, 5.85, 6.4]},
    {"beat": 186.15, "text": "If a ^PIANO from the freight car played your funeral, you fool?", "at": [0.0, 0.6, 1.45, 1.95, 2.9, 3.4, 3.9, 4.45, 4.95, 5.5, 6.5, 7.5]},
    {"beat": 194.25, "text": "I'll derail your little gears, kid, I'll unwind your spring,", "at": [0.0, 0.85, 1.45, 2.4, 2.9, 3.9, 4.95, 5.55, 6.4, 6.85]},
    {"beat": 203.1, "text": "'Cause a watch ain't worth a nickel when it's lost its ting-a-ling!", "at": [0.0, 0.1, 0.6, 0.95, 1.75, 2.2, 2.55, 3.15, 3.95, 4.5, 5.55, 6.65]},
    {"beat": 210.65, "text": "It's the end of the line! Chugga chugga choo! Chugga chugga choo!", "at": [0.0, 0.85, 1.1, 2.0, 2.5, 3.1, 4.45, 4.65, 5.15, 6.15, 6.25, 7.0]},
    {"beat": 219.65, "text": "The end of the line! I'm comin' for you!", "at": [0.0, 0.1, 1.0, 1.5, 2.05, 3.0, 4.1, 5.0, 6.1]},
    {"beat": 227.6, "text": "Tick-tock, little clock, your ticket's overdue,", "at": [0.0, 1.55, 1.7, 4.05, 4.15, 4.95]},
    {"beat": 234.7, "text": "It's the end of the line! ^TOOT! ^TOOT! Choo-choo!", "at": [0.0, 0.4, 1.4, 3.15, 4.4, 5.05, 6.5, 6.6, 8.0]},
    {"beat": 259.1, "text": "Here comes the tunnel... and it's dark as tar...", "at": [0.0, 1.05, 2.0, 2.65, 3.55, 4.05, 4.7, 5.6, 6.4]},
    {"beat": 268.05, "text": "Can't see the tracks, kid... can't see how far...", "at": [0.0, 0.5, 0.95, 1.2, 2.8, 3.1, 4.05, 4.5, 5.5]},
    {"beat": 275.3, "text": "But I can hear you tick-tick, tick-tick, tick-tick...", "at": [0.0, 0.4, 0.85, 1.35, 1.85, 2.4, 4.45, 6.4]},
    {"beat": 282.55, "text": "So run, little ticker, 'cause I'm comin' up ^QUICK!", "at": [0.0, 1.1, 2.6, 3.1, 4.35, 4.6, 5.55, 6.1, 6.6]},
    {"beat": 295.1, "text": "And it's the end of the line! Chugga chugga choo! Chugga chugga choo!", "at": [0.0, 1.05, 2.6, 2.7, 3.5, 4.05, 5.0, 6.0, 6.2, 6.7, 7.55, 7.7, 8.55]},
    {"beat": 305.15, "text": "The end of the line! I'm almost onto you!", "at": [0.0, 0.9, 1.4, 2.5, 2.6, 3.5, 4.55, 5.4, 6.5]},
    {"beat": 313.65, "text": "Tick-tock, little clock, your time is... wait... what's ^THAT?!", "at": [0.0, 1.05, 1.6, 2.95, 3.05, 3.5, 4.4, 5.4, 5.95]},
    {"beat": 321.15, "text": "The ^BRIDGE is ^OUT?! Oh no, no, no, no... ^KER-RASH!", "at": [0.0, 0.5, 1.4, 2.55, 3.85, 4.7, 6.15, 7.2, 8.2, 12.25]}
  ],
